    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BARRY AUCTIONEERS & VALUERS are delighted to bring to the market, Trenarran a superb four bedroomed semi detached home, immaculately maintained and standing on a generous corner site with detached garage and side entrance.  Situated on the highly sought after Pouladuff Road, this impressive property occupies a generous corner site and boasts tarmac driveway with parking for 3 cars, mature and well maintained front and side gardens and a fully enclosed south east facing rear garden, ideal for enjoying morning and afternoon sunshine.\r\n\r\nConveniently located, the property enjoys easy access to a wide range of local amenities and is within a 20-minute walk of Cork city centre, Wilton, CUH and UCC are also within easy reach. The south link road network is also easily accessible.\r\n\r\nTrenarran has well-proportioned accommodation comprising of a reception hallway, a bright living room, family room, open plan kitchen/dining area, shower room, two bedrooms on the ground floor. The first floor has two more bedrooms and access to the attic which has the benefit of flooring and electricity. The detached garage is accessible to the front via a steel roller door and a side door in the rear garden."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Hallway: - \r\nspacious hall, carpeted, stairs to first floor & under stairs storage.\r\n\r\nLiving room: - 4.82m x 3.81m \r\n overlooking front of property, large window, open fire with tiled surround, carpet & curtains.\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.96m x 3.04m \r\nlarge double room, overlooking front of property, bespoke built in wardrobes, carpet & curtains.\r\n\r\nFamily room - 4.45m x 4.0m \r\n overlooking rear garden, open fire with tiled surround fireplace, timber floor & curtains.  \n\r\n\r\nDining area with Kitchen off - 3.51m x 3.35m \r\n dining area with fitted units and worktop, open fire with tiled surround, hot press, timber effect floor & curtains\n\r\n\r\nKitchen - 2.5m x 2.0m \r\n fitted floor & eye level units, worktop, sink and drainer overlooking rear garden, extensively tiled, door to patio area.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 2.53m x 2.44m \r\nover looking rear garden, built in storage, carpeted\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR:Bedroom 3 - 5.12m x 3.8m \r\nLarge double room, overlooking rear of property with built in storage, carpet & curtains.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 3.0m x 2.34m \r\n Single bedroom overlooking rear of property, built in unit, carpeted\r\n\r\nAttic: - \r\nExtensive attic space, ideal storage area with insulated flooring & lights\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE: - \r\nLarge detached garage 5.81m x 4.40m with roller shutter door to the front and side door entrance to rear garden.\nSide gate to rear garden.\nTotally private manicured South East facing garden, boundaries are timber, concrete fencing and hedging. Paved patio ideal for outdoor dining\nSensor lighting to front, side and back of property\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Exceptionally well maintained 4 bedroomed semi-detached home\t\r\nLarge corner site with potential for future expansion (subject to necessary planning requirements) \r\nConveniently located just a short distance from Cork City\r\nOil Central heating & double glazed PVC windows\r\nWell-maintained private garden areas to the front & rear which is laid to lawn and features mature trees, shrubs and plants\r\nFully alarmed, High Speed Fibre Optic WIFI"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: D"
      }
    ],
